## A bare `_build` matches only the root one -- each umbrella app has its own,
## and together they are the largest thing left in the context. Same for the
## per-app ex_doc output.
**/_build
**/doc
_checkouts
__checkouts
.vscode
erlang_ls.config
erlang_ls.config.template
doc
examples
deployment
jepsen
bench
_design
_notes
_spec
_out
monitoring
## `proofs/tla/states` alone is ~1.5 GB of TLC state files. Nothing under
## proofs/ is used by the release build, and uploading it dominates the
## remote-builder context transfer.
proofs
## Nothing in the build reads git: the release version is literal in
## rebar.config and pre_hooks is empty.
.git
## M0 config template is delivered to the VM via fly.toml [[files]] (read from
## disk at deploy), never baked into the image — keep it out of the build
## context so editing it does not bust the release build cache.
harness/m0-fly-spike/config
harness/perf-cluster/config
